This product includes an independent implementation of GGUF model loading, tokenization and inference.
It reads the GGUF file format and is validated against llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp, MIT License)
and the `gguf` Python package; no llama.cpp source code is included. Model files are not distributed with this project
and remain under their own licenses.
